# Line endings, pinned. Mixed CRLF/LF edits from Windows and Linux sessions
# turned one-line changes into whole-file diffs and conflicts (2026-09-25).
# The repo stores LF; *.ps1 checks out CRLF for Windows PowerShell.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.cpp  text eol=lf
*.h    text eol=lf
*.ini  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bin  binary
